<title>CANADA: Counsel in US$50 mln debenture offer.</title>
<headline>Counsel in US$50 mln debenture offer.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Counsel Corp said on Tuesday that it has entered into an agreement to complete a US$50 million bought-deal offering of convertible debentures.</p>
<p>The debentures have a six percent interest coupon, seven-year term and are convertible into Counsel common shares at US$13.875 per share.</p>
<p>The underwriting group is led by Nesbitt Burns Inc, a unit of Bank of Montreal.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
